From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tyler Baker <tyler.baker@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:36:17 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] FROMLIST: arm64: dts: qcom: eliza: add the APSS watchdog

XBL leaves the non-secure APSS watchdog (timer block at 0x17410000,
bark on GIC SPI 0) running when it hands over. On the stock software
stack Gunyah owns it and keeps it serviced; with no hypervisor nothing
does, and it bites about 30 s after XBL hands over unless the next
stage takes the watchdog over in time.

Describe the watchdog in the Eliza DT, status "reserved" as Gunyah owns
it when Linux runs at EL1, with the binding entry it needs.

This is the Linux change (dt-bindings: watchdog: qcom-wdt: add Eliza,
and arm64: dts: qcom: eliza: add the APSS watchdog) applied to
dts/upstream ahead of its merge; drop this commit when dts/upstream
syncs a Linux release that carries it. Not posted yet.

Signed-off-by: Tyler Baker <tyler.baker@oss.qualcomm.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 dts/upstream/Bindings/watchdog/qcom-wdt.yaml | 1 +
 dts/upstream/src/arm64/qcom/eliza.dtsi       | 9 +++++++++
 2 files changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/dts/upstream/Bindings/watchdog/qcom-wdt.yaml b/dts/upstream/Bindings/watchdog/qcom-wdt.yaml
index 9f861045b71..96eaee18281 100644
--- a/dts/upstream/Bindings/watchdog/qcom-wdt.yaml
+++ b/dts/upstream/Bindings/watchdog/qcom-wdt.yaml
@@ -17,6 +17,7 @@ properties:
     oneOf:
       - items:
           - enum:
+              - qcom,apss-wdt-eliza
               - qcom,apss-wdt-glymur
               - qcom,kpss-wdt-ipq4019
               - qcom,apss-wdt-ipq5018
diff --git a/dts/upstream/src/arm64/qcom/eliza.dtsi b/dts/upstream/src/arm64/qcom/eliza.dtsi
index 66ea4aaafd7..8bd88d16435 100644
--- a/dts/upstream/src/arm64/qcom/eliza.dtsi
+++ b/dts/upstream/src/arm64/qcom/eliza.dtsi
@@ -3688,6 +3688,15 @@
 			};
 		};
 
+		apss_watchdog: watchdog@17410000 {
+			compatible = "qcom,apss-wdt-eliza", "qcom,kpss-wdt";
+			reg = <0x0 0x17410000 0x0 0x1000>;
+			clocks = <&sleep_clk>;
+			interrupts = <GIC_SPI 0 IRQ_TYPE_EDGE_RISING>;
+
+			status = "reserved"; /* Reserved by Gunyah */
+		};
+
 		apps_rsc: rsc@17a00000 {
 			compatible = "qcom,rpmh-rsc";
 			reg = <0x0 0x17a00000 0x0 0x10000>,
-- 
2.43.0

